# Feedback-retrained model weights — generated at runtime by
# POST /api/v1/feedback/retrain (and the scheduler's reflection cycle), which the
# matcher then prefers over the committed base model. Machine-specific and
# regenerable from the feedback rows in the DB, so it stays out of git; delete it
# to revert to exports/model_params.json. NOTE: the base model_params.json IS
# tracked (the app loads it at runtime) — do not broaden this to exports/*.json.
exports/model_params_feedback.json

# Logs
*.log

# Claude internal context + local tool settings (not for the team).
# .claude/settings.json holds per-machine tool permissions (absolute local paths),
# so it is local-only rather than shared.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Third-party course material — kept locally, never committed
GenAI_Lecture01_Intro.pdf
GenAI_CourseProject_GradingCriteria.pdf

# Presentations — kept locally, delivered separately (not in the code repo)
*.pptx

# Word documents — the reports/proposal are submitted separately (Moodle);
# their Markdown sources stay in the repo. Kept locally, not committed.
*.docx

# Pitch video — large media, submitted separately as a report attachment
Pitch Video/
